## Theorems (all in module Jsp616)
- IsSumFree : finite subset is sum-free (no element equals a sum of two members)
- interval / countSumFree : count via finite powerset enumeration (decidable)
- count_1 .. count_7 : exact counts c(n) = 2,3,6,9,16,24,42 for n=1..7,
  each by native_decide (closed decision procedure)

